ssing we do this quite regularly in  the brakes what i enjoy even more is  probably table tennis so the plate is  most of the time used for meetings there  are many lunch options around the office  so today we decided to go for a shavama  plate which i like quite a lot we  enjoyed it outside in the sun before  then heading back to the office and of  course refreshing us with a nice black  coffee i love to ring lots of coffee so  often just dilute it with water just to  make sure i do not drink too much  because otherwise i would be able to  drink several cups every day which is of  course not very healthy after lunch i  meet the marketing team we are currently  discussing some new lead nurturing  strategies we want to implement so we're  sitting in front of the pc because  several members are dialed in from the  home office and then after this meeting  i met together with another colleague  and we were discussing some strategies  for our events so webinars and other  events that we are planning for the rest  of the year to get us on track on the  marketing side after that i'm meeting  one of the co-founders of building  raider and we are reviewing some  high-level business numbers on the  marketing and sales side and also  discussing some strategic initiatives  that will be now focused for us over the  next weeks after that it's time to get  home using public transit i usually then  sit together with my wife in the  evenings to have some dinner and then  afterwards it's time to go back to the  desk get some additional emails and  paper work done the evenings is often  also the time i use for my firm learning  work so indeed i was editing this very  video that i was filming during the day  so after that i was going back to answer  even more emails many of them also from  you but then it's time to call it a day  and just go to bed so hope this was  interesting please like if you enjoyed  the video and leave me a comment whether  you want to see more content like that 